% Changed records: each breaks one rule.

% CLIENT_C03 and DEALER_D03 have no master agreement.
scenario no master agreement is:
    the day 2018-10-11 begins from 1 to 2.
    DEALER_D03 proposes the new trade XTEST00001 with CLIENT_C03 for 50000000 from 2 to 3.
    CLIENT_C03 accepts XTEST00001 from 3 to 4.
    the ledger applies XTEST00001 from 4 to 5.

% The termination of BHNAFG4NEC applied on 12 November, before CLIENT_C03
% accepted it and the day before it takes effect.
scenario applied too early is:
    the day 2018-10-10 begins from 1 to 2.
    CCP_P01 proposes the new trade BHNAFG4NEC with CLIENT_C03 for 15000000 from 2 to 3.
    CLIENT_C03 accepts BHNAFG4NEC from 3 to 4.
    the ledger applies BHNAFG4NEC from 4 to 5.
    the day 2018-11-12 begins from 4 to 5.
    CCP_P01 proposes XJKUGGSW2D to terminate BHNAFG4NEC effective on 2018-11-13 from 5 to 6.
    the ledger applies XJKUGGSW2D from 7 to 8.
    the day 2018-11-13 begins from 7 to 8.
    CLIENT_C03 accepts XJKUGGSW2D from 8 to 9.

% The partial termination of DOBAKDKLSO (200 million of 400 million),
% recorded twice: the second time it takes off the whole notional left.
scenario terminated twice is:
    the day 2018-09-25 begins from 1 to 2.
    DEALER_D01 proposes the new trade DOBAKDKLSO with CCP_P01 for 400000000 from 2 to 3.
    CCP_P01 accepts DOBAKDKLSO from 3 to 4.
    the ledger applies DOBAKDKLSO from 4 to 5.
    the day 2018-10-25 begins from 4 to 5.
    DEALER_D01 proposes QUPLAGMH3Q to terminate 200000000 of DOBAKDKLSO effective on 2018-10-26 from 5 to 6.
    CCP_P01 accepts QUPLAGMH3Q from 6 to 7.
    the day 2018-10-26 begins from 7 to 8.
    the ledger applies QUPLAGMH3Q from 8 to 9.
    DEALER_D01 proposes QUPLAGMH3R to terminate 200000000 of DOBAKDKLSO effective on 2018-10-26 from 9 to 10.
    CCP_P01 accepts QUPLAGMH3R from 10 to 11.
    the ledger applies QUPLAGMH3R from 11 to 12.
    the ledger applies QUPLAGMH3R from 12 to 13.

% The trade UCHHDZUPPF is novated after its termination, by a party that
% does not hold it, and accepted by a party that is not a party to it.
scenario dead trade is:
    the day 2018-09-27 begins from 1 to 2.
    CCP_P01 proposes the new trade UCHHDZUPPF with CLIENT_C04 for 900000000 from 2 to 3.
    CLIENT_C04 accepts UCHHDZUPPF from 3 to 4.
    the ledger applies UCHHDZUPPF from 4 to 5.
    the day 2018-10-29 begins from 4 to 5.
    CCP_P01 proposes FVNGREI6FS to terminate UCHHDZUPPF effective on 2018-10-30 from 5 to 6.
    CLIENT_C04 accepts FVNGREI6FS from 6 to 7.
    the day 2018-10-30 begins from 7 to 8.
    the ledger applies FVNGREI6FS from 8 to 9.
    the day 2018-11-05 begins from 9 to 10.
    DEALER_D02 proposes NVTEST0001 to novate 900000000 of UCHHDZUPPF from CLIENT_C04 to DEALER_D01 as UCHHDZUPPG effective on 2018-11-06 from 10 to 11.
    CLIENT_C05 accepts NVTEST0001 from 11 to 12.

